{"lang":"zh","dir":"ltr","title":"C&#39;s Cuts | 加州费尔菲尔德理发店：渐变、修边与勾线","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">跳到主要内容</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C&#39;s</span><span>C&#39;s Cuts</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">关于我们</a><a href=\"#services\">服务</a><a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a><a href=\"#gallery\">照片</a><a href=\"#reviews\">评价</a><a href=\"#visit\">营业时间和地址</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"语言\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\" selected>中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">致电</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">理发店 · 加州费尔菲尔德 · 始于 2010 年</p>\n    <h1>C&#39;s Cuts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">干净的渐变、利落的勾线，还有不赶时间的理发师。自 2010 年起就是费尔菲尔德的街坊理发店。</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · Google 上的 135 条评价<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 来电预留位置</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 导航</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>创立于 2010 年</li><li>欢迎直接到店</li><li>现金或 Zelle</li><li>儿童理发</li><li>私人停车场</li><li>无障碍通道</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">关于本店</p><h2>不赶时间，只为剪好每一个头。</h2><p>C&#39;s Cuts（又名 C&#39;s Barber Shop）自 2010 年起在 North Texas Street 为大家理发。我们擅长清爽短发、修边、渐变、平头、修剪和剃刀勾线。</p><p>Chris、Christine 和团队其他成员做事不急不躁、注重细节，聊起来也很轻松。很多家长也会带孩子来。</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>135 条评价</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>直接到店</b><span>欢迎</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2010</b><span>创立</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"C&#39;s Cuts 刚剪好的渐变发型\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">理发椅上</p><h2>剪发与服务</h2><p>我们的拿手项目。想要定制发型，尽管跟理发师说。</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>清爽理发</h3></div><p>你常剪的发型，修整成你喜欢的样子。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>渐变</h3></div><p>低、中、高位渐变和光头渐变，过渡干净自然。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>修边</h3></div><p>后颈和鬓角干净利落的修边。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>平头</h3></div><p>短、经典、好打理。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>修剪</h3></div><p>保留长度，整体修整利落。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>剃刀勾线</h3></div><p>用直刃剃刀收尾，边线清晰。</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>儿童理发</h3></div><p>对小朋友（和挑剔的家长）都很有耐心的理发师。</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">价格未在网上公布。请致电 (707) 673-7601 了解最新价格。付款方式：仅限现金或 Zelle。</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">温馨提示</p><h2>来之前须知</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>欢迎直接到店</b></li><li><b>现金或 Zelle</b><span>不收信用卡</span></li><li><b>私人停车场</b><span>不占路边、有照明的停车场，前后都有入口</span></li><li><b>自行车停放处</b></li><li><b>无障碍通道</b></li><li><b>儿童理发</b><span>很多家长带孩子来</span></li><li><b>创立于 2010 年</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">相册</p><h2>店里的作品</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"贴头皮渐变配利落勾线\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/textured-cut.jpg\" alt=\"渐变配较长的纹理感顶发\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"位于 2240 N Texas St 的 C&#39;s Cuts 店面\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront-2.jpg\" alt=\"C&#39;s Cuts 入口和理发店旋转灯柱\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">评价</p><h2>费尔菲尔德人的首选</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 135 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Google 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 34 条评价</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在 Yelp 上查看更多评价 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Woke up this morning took a quick glance in the mirror; and thought to myself &quot;Dam C!!!! you did a great job on the haircut....Thnx Bro!!&quot; Cya on the nxt1”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best haircut I’ve had in my two years in Cali and I’ll definitely be here every month. I recommend this shop to anyone who wants a legit cut for a legit price (don’t forget to tip). They make sure you’re not looking in the mirror afterwards wondering why you still go to them.”</blockquote><figcaption>— T&#39;Arris B. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Found my new go to barber in Fairfield. Chris and Christine are cool people, and all the barbers know what they’re doing. My first time I got a fresh fade from Christine. They take their time to give you the best cut for your money. Definitely recommend checking them out. Support your local Filipino shop!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Thomas A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Just got a cut from Chris and it was honestly one of the best I’ve had. He took his time, paid attention to every detail, and the fade came out super clean. The top was shaped perfectly, and you can tell he genuinely cares about his clients. He’s down to earth, easy to talk to, and really takes pride in what he does. If you’re looking for someone who doesn’t rush and delivers high-quality work, Chris is the one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C’s Barbershop is great. I get my haircut by Chris. He’s a stand up guy — a great barber and friend. Always offers good conversation and takes pride in his craft. I always leave the shop feeling good about myself. My friend also gets his haircut by Chris’ wife, and she is talented as well. Affordable prices and great company has me coming back as a regular!”</blockquote><figcaption>— James R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C&#39;s cuts has been my go-to place for almost 15 years for my hair cut needs. The environment is always great, and well-rounded barbers with steady hands are always hard to find, especially ones for such a great price. I truly recommend everybody to get their cuts, line ups, and fades at C&#39;s. You won&#39;t regret how great you look and feel afterward”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Chris and Christine takes their time to cut my hair. They are both very skilled barbers. Highly recommended if you want a nice clean and sharp looking haircut. Hint: go to either Chris and Christine first for your first time haircut.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alexander C. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I’ve been coming to this place for a couple years now, and they’ve always been really kind and understanding. Before finding this place I had a really rough time finding someone who could cut my hair the way I like it, and by my surprise I found it down the street from me. 100/100 I’d recommend this place, and if you’re into a more chilled out vibe this is the place.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have two young boys and I can be very picky on who cuts their hair. I tend to have the usual people cut their hair but unfortunately none of them were available. I decided to go where my nephew always goes, C’s Barbershop. Let me just say that I’m very impressed !! Shoutout to the talented female who cut their hair! I wish I knew her name! I will definitely be bringing them back to her :)”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jeanette A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">常见问题</p><h2>常见问题解答</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>需要预约吗？</summary><p>不需要，直接来就行。如果你想预约或了解要等多久，请致电 (707) 673-7601。</p></details><details><summary>收信用卡吗？</summary><p>我们不收信用卡，只收现金或 Zelle。</p></details><details><summary>营业时间是什么时候？</summary><p>我们周一至周六上午 10 点至下午 5 点营业，周日休息。营业时间可能会变动，请提前来电。</p></details><details><summary>在哪里停车？</summary><p>我们有私人停车场和两个入口，一个在前面，一个在后面。</p></details><details><summary>给小孩理发吗？</summary><p>理！很多家长都带儿子来。</p></details><details><summary>店开了多久了？</summary><p>我们从 2010 年开业至今。</p></details><details><summary>店里有无障碍通道吗？</summary><p>有，我们有无障碍通道。</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\